Process will close any open File Explorer windows Kill explorer.exe with administrator task manager
Use administrator command prompt `RunAs /user:MYDOMAIN\username explorer.exe
User is prompted to enter their password. This re-authenticates with the domain and refreshes permissions/group membership.
